 "fieldData": {
  "awb---faq-data": "<div data-rt-embed-type='true'><div data-rt-embed-type='true'><script> window.awbFAQ = {\"heading\": \"Sales Funnel Page Questions, Answered\", \"items\": [{\"q\": \"What is a sales funnel landing page?\", \"a\": \"A sales funnel landing page is the first page in a sequence built to end in a purchase. It continues the message of the ad, email, or post that sent the click and asks for one action, such as an email address or an order. Later pages carry the visitor toward the sale.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do you build a landing page funnel?\", \"a\": \"Sketch the funnel page by page first, then describe it in one prompt. Emergent's <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-landing-page-builder'>AI landing page builder</a> creates the pages and the buyer table together, with checkout through your Stripe account. A new upsell or a changed price later is another message.\"}, {\"q\": \"Is a landing page the same thing as a sales funnel?\", \"a\": \"No. A landing page and a sales funnel differ in scope: the landing page is one screen with one goal, while the funnel is the full route to a purchase. That route might pass an offer page, a checkout, and a thank you page. Every funnel starts on a landing page, but a newsletter signup page can stand alone.\"}, {\"q\": \"What steps come after the landing page in a sales funnel?\", \"a\": \"An offer page that makes the full case comes next, followed by checkout and often an upsell before the confirmation. Funnels for expensive services swap checkout for an application or a call booking. Some open with a <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-landing-page-builder/webinar-landing-page'>webinar landing page</a> instead of a plain opt-in.\"}, {\"q\": \"What should a funnel landing page include?\", \"a\": \"A headline that names the outcome, one offer, and a button that moves the visitor to the next page. Add proof close to that button, such as a review or the number of customers served. Drop the site menu and footer links, which give the visitor somewhere else to go.\"}, {\"q\": \"What are good sales funnel landing page examples?\", \"a\": \"The useful sales funnel landing page examples are the ones you can follow past the first screen. Buy a cheap product from a brand you admire and note every page and email that follows, with what each one asks for. A gallery screenshot shows the least instructive part.\"}, {\"q\": \"What do strong funnel landing page examples have in common?\", \"a\": \"The headline repeats the words from the ad that sent the visit, and the price or the free offer is clear before any scrolling. Strong funnel landing page examples also make one request per page and nothing else.\"}, {\"q\": \"Where can I find a sales funnel landing page template?\", \"a\": \"Start in the template library of the funnel tool you plan to use, and pick one whose pages run in the order your offer needs. A sales funnel landing page template covers the first page's layout, while checkout and the follow-up emails still need setting up. Emergent works from a description of the whole funnel and builds each step in the same pass.\"}, {\"q\": \"How many pages should a landing page funnel have?\", \"a\": \"As few as the offer allows. A free download needs two: the opt-in and a confirmation. A paid product adds checkout and often an upsell, for four. A software trial may slot a <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-landing-page-builder/pricing-page'>pricing page</a> in before signup. Add a step only when it earns more than the buyers it loses.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do you track conversions in a landing page sales funnel?\", \"a\": \"Tag each visitor with an ID on the first page, carry it through every step, and count how many IDs reach each page. A step's conversion rate is its count divided by the count before it. In an Emergent build, those IDs and counts sit in a database you own.\"}]}; </script></div></div>"
 }
